        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>PART VI, SECTION A, LINES 6, 7A AND 7B:</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE VOTING MEMBERS OF THE LOCAL UNION ARE REGULAR MEMBERS WHO PAY FULL DUES. THESE MEMBERS ELECT THE MEMBERS OF THE GOVERNING BODY AND APPROVE SIGNIFICANT DECISIONS OF THE LOCAL UNION.</ExplanationTxt>
